    "r": "model <- glm(I(as.character(bad_flag) == '1') ~ NetFractionRevolvingBurden + MaxDelq2PublicRecLast12M + NumBank2NatlTradesWHighUtilization + PercentTradesWBalance + MSinceMostRecentInqexcl7days + PercentTradesNeverDelq + AverageMInFile + MSinceOldestTradeOpen + NumTrades60Ever2DerogPubRec + NumTrades90Ever2DerogPubRec + MSinceMostRecentDelq + MaxDelqEver + NumRevolvingTradesWBalance + NumInqLast6M + PercentInstallTrades + NumInqLast6Mexcl7days + NumSatisfactoryTrades + NumTotalTrades + NetFractionInstallBurden + NumTradesOpeninLast12M, data=woe_train, family=binomial())\nwoe_train$predicted_pd <- predict(model, type='response')\nfactor <- 20.0 / log(2)\nbase_odds <- 50.0\noffset <- 600.0 - factor * log(base_odds)\nwoe_train$score <- offset + factor * predict(model, type='link')\n",
    "sas": "proc logistic data=work.woe_train descending;\n  model bad_flag = NetFractionRevolvingBurden MaxDelq2PublicRecLast12M NumBank2NatlTradesWHighUtilization PercentTradesWBalance MSinceMostRecentInqexcl7days PercentTradesNeverDelq AverageMInFile MSinceOldestTradeOpen NumTrades60Ever2DerogPubRec NumTrades90Ever2DerogPubRec MSinceMostRecentDelq MaxDelqEver NumRevolvingTradesWBalance NumInqLast6M PercentInstallTrades NumInqLast6Mexcl7days NumSatisfactoryTrades NumTotalTrades NetFractionInstallBurden NumTradesOpeninLast12M;\n  output out=work.scored p=predicted_pd xbeta=log_odds;\nrun;\n\ndata work.scored;\n  set work.scored;\n  factor = 20.0 / log(2);\n  base_odds = 50.0;\n  offset = 600.0 - factor * log(base_odds);\n  score = offset + factor * log_odds;\nrun;\n"
